    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s13-t02-mother-02-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "母题精讲 · 第2题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s13-t02-mother-02",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（25联考）某种农作物一年一熟，每次种植均有0.2的概率歉收，有0.3的概率丰产。问该农作物连续3年丰产的概率是连续3年歉收概率的多少倍？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "2.5以下"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "2.5~3之间"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "3~4.5之间"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "4.5以上"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "C",
        "sourceAnswer": "C"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          137
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          131
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s13-t02-mother-02-p137.webp",
            "alt": "概率问题（二） · 母题精讲2 · 讲义第131页",
            "pdfPage": 137
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s13-t02-mother-02-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s13-t02-mother-02",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：C"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们按各年种植结果相互独立、概率不变的模型，连续3年丰产概率为0.3³，连续3年歉收概率为0.2³。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "两者相除，就是单年概率比的3次方：（3/2）³=27/8=3.375。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "\\frac{(0.3)^3}{(0.2)^3}=\\left(\\frac32\\right)^3=3.375"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "3.375位于3—4.5之间，我们选C。“连续3年”已经固定每一年都发生，不需要再乘组合数。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
