    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s13-t02-practice-01-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "思维精练 · 第1题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s13-t02-practice-01",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（25联考）甲进球概率0.6，乙进球概率0.5，两个人各投两球，甲比乙多进一球的概率是（）。",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "0.3"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "0.4"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "0.5"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "0.6"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "A",
        "sourceAnswer": "A"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          137
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          131
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s13-t02-practice-01-p137.webp",
            "alt": "概率问题（二） · 思维精练1 · 讲义第131页",
            "pdfPage": 137
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s13-t02-practice-01-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s13-t02-practice-01",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：A"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先把“甲比乙多进一球”分清楚：只有甲进1球乙进0球，或者甲进2球乙进1球两类。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "第一类概率为（2×0.6×0.4）×0.5²=0.12；第二类为0.6²×（2×0.5×0.5）=0.18。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "P=\\binom21(0.6)(0.4)(0.5)^2+(0.6)^2\\binom21(0.5)(0.5)=0.3"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "两类互斥，加起来0.3，我们选A。甲进1球时有两种命中顺序，不能漏掉组合系数。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
